  "release_date": "1987-09-21",
  "type": "Album",
  "description": "Heaven on Earth is the second solo studio album by American singer Belinda Carlisle. It was released on October 5, 1987, by MCA Records in North America and Virgin Records globally. Three singles reached the top 10 of the US Billboard Hot 100, including the number-one single and Carlisle's signature song \"Heaven Is a Place on Earth\". The album has been certified Platinum in several countries, including the United States, and triple Platinum in the United Kingdom",
